' ---------- Associations ----------
Account "1" -- "0..*" Session : holds >
Account "1" -- "0..5" SavedLocation : watches >
Account "1" -- "0..*" Report : submits >
Account "1" -- "0..*" Corroboration : confirms >
Account "1" -- "0..*" WorkOrder : assigned >
Account "1" -- "0..*" AuditRecord : acts in >

SavedLocation "1" -- "0..1" AlertSubscription : configured by >
SavedLocation "1" -- "0..*" Alert : triggers >
SavedLocation "0..*" -- "0..1" Cluster : exposed to >

Cluster "1" *-- "1..*" ClusterSnapshot : history
Cluster "1" -- "0..*" PriorityScore : scored as >
Cluster "1" -- "0..1" ClusterRainfall : rainfall state >
Cluster "1" -- "0..*" Report : contains >
Cluster "1" -- "0..*" WorkOrder : targeted by >
Cluster "1" -- "0..*" TreatmentRecord : treated by >
Cluster "0..*" -- "0..1" RegionForecast : forecast by >
note right of RegionForecast
  Cluster.forecastRegion holds the enum value; this
  association carries the forecast text and validity
  period the flag was derived from (1.3.4, 1.3.5).
end note

ClusterRainfall "1" -- "3" RainfallStation : nearest >
RainfallStation "1" -- "0..*" RainfallReading : reports >

PriorityScore "1" *-- "5..7" DriverContribution : breakdown
PriorityScore "0..*" -- "1" PestProfile : scored under >
PestProfile "1" -- "0..*" ObservationRecord : observed as >
PestProfile "1" -- "0..*" Report : classified by >
PestProfile "1" -- "0..*" WorkOrder : classified by >

ReportSpatialGroup "1" o-- "1..*" Report : aggregates nearby
ReportSpatialGroup "0..*" -- "1" PriorityTier : classified by >
note right of ReportSpatialGroup
  Complete-link spatial cluster of reports within
  DEFAULT_REPORT_CLUSTER_DISTANCE_METRES = 100 m.
  Individual Report records are NOT modified; this is
  a read-only aggregation used by DispatchController
  and MapViewController to surface possible duplicates.
end note

Report "1" *-- "0..3" ReportPhoto : evidence
Report "1" -- "0..*" Corroboration : corroborated by >
Report "0..*" -- "0..1" WorkOrder : actioned by >
Report "1" -- "0..1" Referral : referred by >
WorkOrder "0..*" -- "0..1" Report : raised from >

WorkOrder "1" -- "0..1" CompletionEvidence : closed by >
WorkOrder "1" -- "0..1" TreatmentRecord : produces >

note bottom of TreatmentRecord
  Written only when a work order is Verified (8.3.12).
  Feeds the DaysSinceLastTreatment driver, so the next
  score must be lower (4.1.17). This closes the loop.
end note

note bottom of Account
  One role per account (2.2.1). The real NEA / town-council
  split of task types is a recorded simplification, not an
  omission: one Operations Manager, one Cleaning Crew.
end note

note right of PestProfile
  The configuration record that generalises the scorer:
  score = severityMultiplier x urgency (4.2.4). The mosquito
  profile carries severityMultiplier 1.000 and the tier A
  weight set, which is what holds every dengue score
  identical to v0.8 (4.2.5).
end note

note bottom of ObservationRecord
  A third-party sighting, NOT a resident complaint. Obscured
  coordinates and accuracy worse than 500 m are rejected at
  ingestion (1.5.6, 1.5.7) and the driver is labelled
  "recent wildlife activity", never "pest pressure" (4.1.26).
end note

note bottom of VectorControlOperator
  290 NEA-registered operators, geocoded from postal code
  (1.6.1-1.6.8). These are REGISTERED OFFICES, so the driver
  they feed measures response capacity, not demand - which is
  why 4.1.25 carries weight 0.05 and no more.
end note

note bottom of Referral
  Written when the system declines work it has no authority
  to do (8.1.14, 8.6.1). It writes NO TreatmentRecord: the
  locality was not treated, and pretending otherwise would
  corrupt the 4.1.17 feedback loop (8.6.11).
end note

@enduml
